The mail isn't actually stored in the MyS[ql] zar[afa] db. I loaded around 8000 mail items into the zar[afa] and it didn't[ signific]atnly affect the size of the database.
The mail and also the zar[afa]-search indexes (if enabled) are actually stored in the file systm under /var/lib/zar[afa].
The configuration files would give the impression that this is just attachments but it appears to be all emails as well. Each email and attache[ment] is stored in

